  "html": "<p>感謝所有參加&nbsp;114 學年度 EMRD 招生說明會的嘉賓，誠摯地邀請您加入臺科大 EMRD 溫暖的大家庭，建立企業內高階菁英廣闊的人脈與技術網絡，成為具全球視野的科技領袖！</p>\n<p><strong>EMRD 114&nbsp;學年度報名資訊</strong> ( 入學時間為 2025&nbsp;年 9 月 )</p>\n<p>報名時間：113 年 12 月 3&nbsp;日 (二) 09:00 起至 113&nbsp;年 12 月 17&nbsp;日 (二) 12:00 止</p>\n<p>報名方式：一律網路報名及上傳審查資料</p>\n<p>招生簡章：<strong><a href=\"https://www.admission.ntust.edu.tw/var/file/52/1052/img/2675/844763178.pdf\">招生簡章</a></strong></p>\n<p>網路報名網址：<strong><a href=\"https://www.ntust.edu.tw/114entry2\">網路報名網址</a></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>(113/12/03&nbsp;09:00 開放)</strong></p>\n<p>招生資訊：<strong><a href=\"http://drive.google.com/file/d/1QTu2rHoCwld-N8Anb-VYdbvD6AqTTzjo/view?usp=sharing\">招生資訊</a></strong></p>\n<p>報考常見 Q&amp;A：<strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1M8ptX7UhnAiRPU7UjdRjbrrqE5mCxV0H/view?usp=drive_link\">報考常見 Q&amp;A</a></strong></p>\n<p>臺科大 EMRD 關鍵特色：</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;✅&nbsp;技術：全球首創學程 ( 技術長 CTO )</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;✅&nbsp;產業：逾 28 位產官學界跨領域菁英授課&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;✅&nbsp;人脈：高階菁英建立廣闊的人脈與技術網絡</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>歡迎有志報考者加入由 EMRD 校友會所建立的 <u>EMRD 114&nbsp;報名群組</u>，在報考過程中，EMRD 校友會將提供協助，解決各位可能遇到的問題。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"130\" src=\"/legacy/img/82031e2648-257564270.jpg\" width=\"130\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 114&nbsp;報名群組</p>\n<p><strong>招生說明會活動照片集錦</strong></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/187bcaac49-001.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/8894a92dfe-002.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 游進陽 執行長&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 114&nbsp;學年度招生說明會</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/0fb7bb985e-003.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/0cdd370e4c-007.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>114&nbsp;學年度招生說明會&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;114&nbsp;學年度招生說明會</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/cd2787d8c2-004.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/825ec22b12-005.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 校友 梁進 學長&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;EMRD 校友 譚壽生&nbsp;學長&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/fa233bb988-006.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/a08c235e56-008.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 校友 李金武&nbsp;學長&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; EMRD 校友會 吳欽文 理事長</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/db0fa39aef-010.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/8a1f43ec11-009.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>114&nbsp;學年度招生說明會&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 114&nbsp;學年度招生說明會</p>",
